r" background="textures/row1.jpg"><font size="-6">Summoner </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg">16 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row1.jpg">Petrify </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row1.jpg">Stuns the target. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg"><font size="-6">Summoner </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg">16.3 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row2.jpg">Seism </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row2.jpg">&nbsp;Teleports the caster&#39;s pet(s) back to the caster. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg"><font size="-6">Summoner </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg">17 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row3.jpg">Bludgeoning Earth </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row3.jpg">Deals magic damage over time. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg"><font size="-6">Summoner </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg">18.3 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row1.jpg">Splinter of Essence </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row1.jpg">&nbsp;Summons a consumable on the target party member that restores Power at the cost of Health. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg"><font size="-6">Summoner </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg">19 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row2.jpg">Immobilize </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row2.jpg">Roots the target. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg"><font size="-6">Conjurer </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg">20 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row3.jpg">Igneous Apprentice </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row3.jpg">Summons a Fire Elemental of the Wizard profession </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg"><font size="-6">Conjurer </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg">20 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row1.jpg">Illusion: Fire Elemental </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row1.jpg">Polymorphs the caster into a fire elemental. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg"><font size="-6">Conjurer </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg">21 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row2.jpg">Pullulation </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row2.jpg">Increases the groups power pool and arcane mitigation. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg"><font size="-6">Conjurer </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg">22 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row3.jpg">Shards of Ice </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row3.jpg">Area of effect cold damage and reduced movement speed. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg"><font size="-6">Conjurer </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg">23 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row1.jpg">Fire Seed </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row1.jpg">&nbsp;Augmentation placed on all party members that has a chance to do instant Heat damage, interrupt, and place an impairment on a successful attack. This impairment will cause instant Heat damage to the affected opponent&#39;s en