res/row3.jpg">Instant Vim </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row3.jpg">Converst health to power. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg"><font size="-6">Conjurer </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg">28 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row1.jpg">Repair Servant </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row1.jpg">&nbsp;Replenishes Health instantly to the caster&#39;s pet. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg"><font size="-6">Conjurer </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg">28 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row2.jpg">Volatile Refuge </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row2.jpg">Augmentation that abosorbs an amount of Trauma and Elemental damage </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg"><font size="-6">Conjurer </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg">29 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row3.jpg">Alluvial Brand </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row3.jpg">Increases the groups stamina, intelligence, and cold mitigation. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg"><font size="-6">Conjurer </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg">30 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row1.jpg">Frozen by Time </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row1.jpg">Deals magic damage and stuns the target. </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg"><font size="-6">Conjurer </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg">30 </td><td valign="middle" align="left" background="textures/row2.jpg">Illusion: Water Elemental </td><t